40
00:02:11.917 --> 00:02:34.447
Nature can be very strong. In an earthquake, the ground shakes. A lightning bolt can hit a tall tree. A tornado spins very fast, and a hurricane or a cyclone brings strong wind and rain. A tsunami is a giant wave. In the mountains, there can be a snowstorm or a landslide. Always listen to safety advice!

